   "id": "scene_feather",
   "text": "He was half asleep on the couch when something soft drew across the sole of his foot. His toes curled. It came again, slower, a feather moving up toward the arch, and his whole leg jerked. He bit his lip to keep quiet, shoulders shaking, a snort escaping through his nose. \"Don't,\" he managed, pulling the foot under a cushion. The feather found the other foot.",
